docs/iclr2027

# Ignore all markdown files everywhere
*.md
**/*.md

# Un-ignore the root README.md
!README.md

# Preserve the supplied P00 handoff in version control; historical source stays ignored.
!AGENTS.md
!docs/*.md
!docs/prompts/*.md
!docs/templates/*.md
!reports/**/*.md
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
tmp/
artifacts/development/**
!artifacts/development/.gitkeep
artifacts/final/**
!artifacts/final/.gitkeep
